cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the manuscript."
title: "Fuzzy DSS for AI-Augmented Software Development"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of a Mamdani-style fuzzy inference system that
  classifies software-engineering project health under AI-augmented delivery,
  using three input metrics (DSPD, LTBF, Qd) and a 12-rule expert-elicited
  rule base.
